This project originated at Acaysia (https://github.com/AcaysiaChem) and is
intended to be governed independently of it.

The core package has no Acaysia dependencies. Proprietary and copyleft
simulation engines integrate through the same rtcbench.plant.Plant protocol as
every other backend, out of tree, and do not host scored tasks -- see DESIGN.md
sections 1, 2 and 7.

Process models in rtcbench/plants/ are independent reimplementations from
published equations. Sources are cited in each module's docstring.
